Let crate.annotation_select set rustc environment variables for chosen triples

A crate can need an environment variable for some triples only, such as
RUSTC_BOOTSTRAP where it enables unstable features on one target and not on
the others. Taking rustc_env among the selectable attributes lets such a
variable be set for the triples that need it without setting it for every
other triple, where it would change the crate's compile actions too.

Written to be offered upstream on top of the patch that selects deps.

License: Apache-2.0 (rules_rs 0.0.112)

